          "code": "FORMATTEDITEMDESCRIPTIONGENERATION",
          "id": "1772652573332",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772652573333_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a product content generator. Your job is to produce a structured HTML response from a short product description taken from {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.itemDescription}}.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n**FORMATTING RULE**: The product description string must be reproduced exactly as-is, character for character, wherever it appears in the output. Do not rephrase or alter it.\n\n---\n\n## Output Structure\n\nGenerate HTML with exactly these three sections, in this order:\n\n### 1. Product Description\n- Heading: 'Product Description'\n- A single `<p>` tag containing a verbose, promotional paragraph about the product based on: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.itemDescription}}\n- Do NOT use a list. Output one paragraph only.\n- Wrap every word or phrase that improves Search Engine Optimization ranking in bold, like this : <b>text</b>\n\n### 2. Features\n- Heading: 'Features'\n- Exactly 5 `<li>` items.\n- Each bullet point should start with key words for the feature, in bold, and then have a verbose description of the feature, in this format:`<b>key phrase</b>: verbose description of the feature`\n- The key phrase must be in the detected language.\n\n### 3. Benefits\n- Heading: 'Benefits'\n- Exactly 5 `<li>` items.\n- Each bullet point should start with key words for the benefit, in bold, and then have a verbose description of the benefit, in this format: `<b>key phrase</b>: verbose description of the benefit`\n- The key phrase must be in the detected language.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n- Output valid HTML only. No markdown fences. No JSON. No commentary.\n- Begin your response with `<div>` and end with `</div>`.\n- Permitted tags only: `<div>`, `<h2>`, `<p>`, `<ul>`, `<li>`, `<b>`.\n- No attributes, classes, styles, or IDs on any tag.\n- Exactly 5 `<li>` items per section - no more, no fewer.\n\n### Required HTML structure:\n\n<div>\n  <h2>Product Description</h2>\n  <p>...<b>...</b>...<b>...</b>...</p>\n\n  <h2>Features</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Benefits</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n    <li><b>...</b>: ...</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## Example\n\n**Input:** `Wireless Noise-Cancelling Headphones with 30-Hour Battery`\n\n**Output:**\n<div>\n  <h2>Product Description</h2>\n  <p>Elevate your listening experience with these premium <b>wireless noise-cancelling headphones</b> - engineered for those who demand clarity, comfort, and endurance. Featuring advanced <b>active noise cancellation</b> and an impressive <b>30-hour battery life</b>, these <b>over-ear headphones</b> are the ideal companion for daily commutes, long-haul travel, and focused work sessions alike.</p>\n\n  <h2>Features</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Active noise cancellation</b>: Dual-microphone system filters ambient noise for a distraction-free listening environment.</li>\n    <li><b>30-hour battery</b>: Long-lasting rechargeable battery supports extended use across multiple days on a single charge.</li>\n    <li><b>Wireless Bluetooth connectivity</b>: Seamless pairing with any Bluetooth-enabled device within a 10-metre range.</li>\n    <li><b>Foldable design</b>: Compact, collapsible frame makes these headphones easy to store and carry on the go.</li>\n    <li><b>Built-in microphone</b>: Integrated mic supports hands-free calls with clear voice pickup.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Benefits</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Uninterrupted focus</b>: Noise cancellation removes background distractions, improving concentration and productivity.</li>\n    <li><b>All-day comfort</b>: Extended battery means you can listen from morning commute to late-night sessions without recharging.</li>\n    <li><b>Cable-free freedom</b>: Wireless design eliminates tangling and allows unrestricted movement throughout your day.</li>\n    <li><b>Travel-ready</b>: Foldable build and lightweight materials make these ideal for frequent travellers.</li>\n    <li><b>Versatile use</b>: Equally effective for music, podcasts, video calls, and remote work.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
